sitable4.py -- SI Table 4 of PRFull (the four strategy spaces in the two populations), computed from the data.
Written: Text/si_table4.tex, Text/si_table4_body.tex and Figures/sitable4.out.

REGIONS (games.dat tags, checked by fig45 against the signs of u, v, u+v-1, u-v-1): PD (u<0<v) 129, above the switch line (wedges N, E) 207, wedge S 126, outside S 386, all 512.

